<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms to seek 30,000T soymeal in tender.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms to seek 30,000T soymeal in tender.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyer group, known as the Big Feed Mills, would invite tenders to buy 30,000 tonnes of soymeal by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Wednesday, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>They said arrival was set for September 20 to the two South Korean ports of Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for August 10-31 if sourced from India, or for July 20-August 10 if from South America.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
